Description: light-weight C++23 application framework
 Islands is a C++23 application framework: an engine core hosting
 services (window, graphics, audio, terminal, networking) with content
 delivered as cartridges, bundles of code and assets on one contract,
 loaded dynamically or linked statically. This package installs the
 engine under /opt/islands with its launcher, and the islands command
 that runs it.

